{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "studymate", "elements": [{"id": "529710123375406a", "type": "text", "x": 30, "y": 22, "width": 286.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 954816442, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 288083024, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Computer Science · Scene 3", "originalText": "Computer Science · Scene 3", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "9828a51b9e034fc2", "type": "text", "x": 594.3, "y": 60, "width": 411.40000000000003, "height": 55.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 784947490, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 209281551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stacks and Queues", "originalText": "Stacks and Queues", "fontSize": 44, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "b11f7e24cb364701", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1230, "y": 180, "width": 320, "height": 160, "angle": 0.03, "strokeColor": "#e8c547", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 77065968, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 291990910, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "4539b35200f04b79", "type": "text", "x": 1250, "y": 200, "width": 266.20000000000005, "height": 110.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1062754043, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 465975919, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stacks use LIFO (last\nin, first out); queues\nuse FIFO (first in,\nfirst out).", "originalText": "Stacks use LIFO (last\nin, first out); queues\nuse FIFO (first in,\nfirst out).", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "2c1e48d07b714b18", "type": "rectangle", "x": 120, "y": 728.0, "width": 1360, "height": 142.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "#343a40", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 554010464, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 936650470, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "7c1f354848b04a0d", "type": "text", "x": 145, "y": 743.0, "width": 1100.0, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#ffffff", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 646448840, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 904409542, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A stack is like a pile of plates: you push a plate on top and pop it from the top, so the last plate\nin is the first one out. Stacks are used for undo buttons and function calls. A queue is like a line\nat a shop: you add items to the back and remove them from the front, so the first item in is the\nfirst out. Queues are used for scheduling tasks and print jobs.", "originalText": "A stack is like a pile of plates: you push a plate on top and pop it from the top, so the last plate\nin is the first one out. Stacks are used for undo buttons and function calls. A queue is like a line\nat a shop: you add items to the back and remove them from the front, so the first item in is the\nfirst out. Queues are used for scheduling tasks and print jobs.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "06f46008bec543bd", "type": "rectangle", "x": 280.0, "y": 265.75, "width": 150, "height": 63.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#FFA07A", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 511025151, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 280080821, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "b9cf1de659524df1", "type": "text"}, {"id": "f9ca18fe2a8d4d3b", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "41f8fd3c314b4c24", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "b9cf1de659524df1", "type": "text", "x": 324.75, "y": 283.75, "width": 60.50000000000001, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 794472659, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1018022224, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Stack", "originalText": "Stack", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "06f46008bec543bd", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"type": "line", "version": 1, "versionNonce": 777519105, "isDeleted": false, "id": "ef67745ffe324fac", "fillStyle": "hachure", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "